 representation of interaction of inhibitor Laur-DArg-DPhe-OMe with a whole hydrophobic cage without its sub-division on pockets.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOBIOCJ-2-143_F4"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Inhibitory Activity of the <italic>Retro</italic> -D-Sequence of DArg-D-Phe Peptides - Modified on the &#x003b1;-Amino Group of Arginine</p></caption><table frame="border" rules="all" width="100%"><thead><tr><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02116;</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Compounds</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">IC<sub>50</sub>&#x000b5;M</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Ki &#x000b5;M</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>1</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cbz-D-Arg-D-Phe-OMe</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">110</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">42&#x000b1;5</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>2</bold></td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Chrom-D-Arg-D-Phe-OMe<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="T1FN1">*</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">56</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14,35&#x000b1;0,92</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>3</bold></td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Laur-D-Arg-D-Phe-OMe</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">-//-</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,76&#x000b1;0,09</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="T1FN1"><label>*</label><p>Inhibitory effect was studied in the same buffer containing 3% DMSO in final concentration.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>